 {
  "page": "discovery.seed",
  "state": "view-popover",
  "hash": "discovery/seed?step=2&profile=1",
  "actions": [
   {
    "wait_for": [
     "[data-testid=\"run-preview\"], [data-testid=\"seed-preview-in\"], [data-testid=\"cut-card\"]",
     60000
    ]
   },
   {
    "click_if": "[data-testid=\"run-preview\"]"
   },
   {
    "wait_for": [
     "[data-testid=\"seed-next-3\"], [data-testid=\"cut-card\"]",
     240000
    ]
   },
   {
    "click_if": "[data-testid=\"seed-next-3\"]"
   },
   {
    "wait_for": [
     "[data-testid=\"cut-card\"]",
     30000
    ]
   },
   {
    "click_if": "[data-testid=\"profile-show\"]"
   },
   {
    "wait_for": [
     "[data-testid=\"profile-view\"]",
     60000
    ]
   },
   {
    "click": "[data-testid=\"profile-view\"]"
   },
   {
    "wait": 300
   }
  ],
  "expect": [
   "[data-testid=\"view-popover\"]",
   "[data-testid=\"view-apply\"]"
  ],
  "settle_ms": 900,
  "_why": "seed-search: the distance profile is behind 'show the distance profile' in step 3 (?profile=1), and step 3 opens only with the draft's preview in hand. Integration fix: the full wave walk met the smoke draft with no preview for the page's query (step 2 'not run yet'), so the profile never drew; the state now runs the preview itself when it is missing, the way zzzzzzzzzzz_a1_seed_search's cut-card states do, and walks on to step 3"
 },
